SUMMARY:Triibü
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:TRiiBü draws inspiration from a wide range of rhythms\, cultur
 es\, and sounds shaped by underground dance music from around the world.\n
 \nBuilt around the idea that music can bring different people\, energies\,
  and backgrounds into the same space\, the project focuses on creating a f
 eeling of shared movement\, connection\, and flow on the dance floor.\n\nA
 t its core\, TRiiBü is about bringing people into a shared flow through m
 usic and movement.\n\nProfile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/trii
 bu
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:1ed3fa68-25ea-4f17-8828-6b2a239a1145@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260618T213000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260618T230000
SUMMARY:Sidelines
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Originating from the Kootenays\, SIDELINES is a 26-year-old DJ 
 and producer shaped by the region’s legendary mountains and bush rave 
 culture. Also heavily influenced by UK Sound\, R&B\, Wobbly Dubstep and F
 at Basslines. Known for high-energy sets that keep dance floors shuffling
  and skanking till the break of dawn. Currently Residing on Salt Spring I
 sland BC\, Striving to create original tracks and throw down on big sound
  systems across the province.\n\nSoundCloud: https://soundcloud.com/elias-
 sweringn\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/sidelinesbc/\n\nProfile: ht
 tps://thenectarfestival.com/products/sidelines
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:711a0210-561c-4209-a8a5-b5b602326749@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260618T230000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260619T003000
SUMMARY:Tempeh
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Tempeh ✷ is a producer focused on dubstep\, bass weight\, and
  deep atmospheric selections. His sound leans into spacious low-end\, roll
 ing rhythms\, and the darker energy of underground sound.\n\nSoundCloud: h
 ttps://soundcloud.com/ty_dale\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/tydale
 .ca/\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/tempehmusic/\n\nProfile: https:
 //thenectarfestival.com/products/tempeh
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ef6f1bab-3c18-42cb-b1ea-e07f90f76407@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260619T003000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260619T020000
SUMMARY:Dyce
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:From deep shuddering basslines to rolling 808s and high energy 
 breaks\, DYCE delivers a memorable sonic experience. His live performances
  span a vast musical landscape\, from Garage\, Breaks\, and Jungle to Chic
 ago Footwork. DYCE delivers hand picked gems from a multitude of undergrou
 nd music outlets and influences. Generating waves in the Island scene\, hi
 s sets are characterized by precision blends\, intricate selection\, and a
 n energetic stage presence.\n\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/_dyce_
 /\nSoundCloud: https://soundcloud.com/frazer-dyson\nLinktree: http://linkt
 r.ee/DYCE.DJ\n\nProfile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/dyce
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:e19f4aa8-f0fb-43a7-b774-0bf2878a6417@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260619T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260619T223000
SUMMARY:Löblová
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Löblová is dedicated to curating unique and thoughtful sound 
 experiences\, made to fully immerse you in the dance. She doesn’t follow
  a script—she reads the room and builds from instinct. Moving fluidly th
 rough UKG\, breakbeat\, DnB\, downtempo\, house\, techno\, and trance\, ea
 ch set is shaped from inspiration in the moment. You won’t know what to 
 expect—and that’s exactly the point - it's unpredictable\, and effortl
 essly dialed\, pulling you deeper without warning.\n\nWith a few decades o
 f experience in the West Coast underground electronic music scene\, she fi
 nally followed her dream and started playing out.  Her excitement for sha
 ring music is contagious\, creating a grounded and uplifting atmosphere fu
 ll of inspiration and desire to hear more. When you catch the vibe she's s
 haring\, you'll only want to hear more.\n\nSoundCloud: https://soundcloud.
 com/loblova\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/_loblova_/\nFacebook: ht
 tps://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61557059444600\n\nProfile: https://t
 henectarfestival.com/products/loblova
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ca34fafa-9bfb-4503-bef8-014ec9506691@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260619T223000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260620T000000
SUMMARY:Triikstr
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:TRiiKSTR is a BC-based DJ and event producer known for shaping 
 immersive\, high-impact dancefloor experiences across underground and fest
 ival settings. Rooted in queer\, fetish\, and rave communities\, their wor
 k is driven by energy\, tension\, and connection\, creating sets that feel
  intentional\, magnetic\, and hard to step away from.\n\nTheir sound moves
  fluidly across minimal\, house\, tech house\, and techno\, with flashes o
 f bass house\, G-house\, and experimental textures woven in to keep moment
 um evolving. Rather than staying fixed in one lane\, TRiiKSTR focuses on p
 acing and control\, building and releasing pressure in ways that keep crow
 ds fully engaged from start to finish.\n\nThey studied music production an
 d performance at DBS Academy in Berlin\, Germany\, bringing a refined tech
 nical foundation to an instinct-led approach on stage.\n\nAs the former co
 -founder of Luminosity Gathering and the founder of open:ended\, TRiiKSTR 
 has contributed to the evolution of inclusive\, forward-thinking dance spa
 ces across Victoria and Salt Spring Island\, where atmosphere\, audience\,
  and intention carry equal weight to sound.\n\nPerformance highlights incl
 ude Shambhala Music Festival\, Salt Spring Island Pride\, Passion Portal\,
  Spank\, Cathaus\, Purr\, Backdoor (Victoria Pride)\, Erotica Electronica\
 , INNIT Festival\, NECTAR Festival\, SPANK BANK at The Vault in Vancouver\
 , and Normie Corp NYE in Victoria\, among others.\n\nKnown for reading a r
 oom quickly and shifting it with precision\, TRiiKSTR delivers sets that b
 uild\, hold\, and release tension in a way that keeps the dancefloor locke
 d in until the very end.\n\nSoundCloud: https://soundcloud.com/triikstr\nI
 nstagram: https://www.instagram.com/triikstr\nFacebook: https://www.facebo
 ok.com/triikstr\n\nProfile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/triikst
 r
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:302ea2f0-2ac0-4d6d-a171-1d410aabd8a8@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260620T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260620T013000
SUMMARY:Audacity
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Based in Vancouver\, Audacity has been carving out a distinct l
 ane in the tech house and bass house scene with a curated sound that leans
  into grindy textures\, deep grooves\, and dark\, rolling basslines. A reg
 ular presence across the West Coast\, Audacity has performed extensively o
 n Vancouver Island\, building a reputation for sets that are as immersive 
 as they are high-impact.\n\nBlending precision mixing with an instinct for
  tension and release\, Audacity crafts dancefloor journeys that feel both 
 intentional and explosive. Each set is a carefully selected progression of
  driving rhythms\, shadowy undertones\, and heavy low-end energy—designe
 d to lock crowds in\, elevate the vibe\, and push late-night atmospheres i
 nto memorable nights.\n\nSoundCloud: https://on.soundcloud.com/gm6pUCxBl98
 VxR2npY\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/dj__audacity?igsh=cXJubzVlNj
 J4b2Nu&utm_source=qr\nSoundCloud: https://on.soundcloud.com/RDh1LFSxbiin1g
 Uwrr\n\nProfile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/audacity
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:a2be9167-0bf8-442f-82ed-89f85151abc9@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260620T013000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260620T030000
SUMMARY:Ænniæ
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:With creativity\, precision and an almost preternatural underst
 anding of the medium\, ÆNNIÆ’s kaleidoscopic approach to mixing draws 
 upon decades of obsessive music collecting and their deep devotion to danc
 e music born from dark\, sweaty clubs in Scotland. The heady and energetic
  cocktail of drummy\, variously textured and often euphoric music they ten
 d to favour holds no allegiance to any one corner of the genre-map\, inste
 ad traversing styles instinctively - from percussive techno to breaks\, ha
 rd-hitting bass\, drum-forward club tracks to heartfelt house and trance -
  and often leaning into the hybrid spaces between genres.\n\nThis musical 
 cartography is also evident in their work as co-founder of Resonance Colle
 ctive\, where they organize events on Lekwungen and WSÁNEĆ Territories f
 ocused on musical innovation\, education\, and simply throwing really good
  parties. ÆNNIÆ has shared lineups with Canadian-based talents like SIM\
 , softcoresoft\, Hrdvsion\, Shanx\, IHA\, Subdidi\, Mood Change\, Njoki Nj
 oki\, Khotin\, and Sergio SP\, as well as international artists Hodge\, so
 ftchaos\, and bastiengoat\, and they’ve performed at festivals including
  Memetic (MB)\, Wonderment (BC) and Samsara (BC). Since 2021\, Resonance C
 ollective have been throwing events\, including their latest event series 
 SHIFT\, their former monthly Depot residency\, and collaborations with cre
 ws such as Gateo (Van)\, Eventide (Vic) and Winter Arts Festival (Van).\n\
 nAs a DJ\, curator and event organizer\, ÆNNIÆ’s aim is to move you.\n
 \nSoundCloud: https://soundcloud.com/aenniae\nInstagram: https://www.insta
 gram.com/aenniae_/\n\nProfile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/aenn
 iae
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:84318f2d-34f2-4cf1-928a-4d09377c2dc2@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260620T030000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260620T043000
SUMMARY:KiiK
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Dark\, hypnotic\, and relentless. KIIK brings heat to the booth
  and sweat to the dance floor.\n\nHer sets are deep\, dark\, and physical 
 - built on rolling basslines\, moody textures\, and rhythms that lock you 
 in.  Blending hypnotic elements and psychedelic sounds\, she knows how to
  push the energy.\n\nBehind the decks\, KIIK is electric. Her movement is 
 constant\, contagious - feeding off the room and giving it right back.\n\n
 SoundCloud: https://soundcloud.com/kiik_dj\nInstagram: https://www.instagr
 am.com/kiik_dj/\n\nProfile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/kiik
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:8b992f06-6c9d-4b20-b3c7-496c5fe4c5df@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260620T043000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260620T060000
SUMMARY:Dose.
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Dose. is the multifaceted DJ & Music project from partners Max 
 & Taylor. With deep selections that traverse fluidly through genres like 9
 0s Trance\, Hard House\, and Techno\; their artistic vision is rooted in s
 haring raw expression from the heart. Their sets are curated as a free flo
 wing and intuitive exploration\, following the dance floor’s lead\, with
  no preconceived plan beyond a catalogue of thousands of songs. Their musi
 c is selected to reflect and pay homage to their roots…not to go backwar
 ds but instead to move forwards with respect for those who created the sou
 nds that are loved and shared today. Moving through multi-genre blends\, t
 heir sound reflects a deep love of music and a passion to continue finding
  inspiration in unique frequencies. Dose. consistently strive to represent
  fem folk\, women\, & queer Artists. Through this Dose. aims to break down
  barriers\, create new industry standards\, & open conversation surroundin
 g the importance of diversity.\n\nMusic is their medium & equality is thei
 r goal.\n\nSoundCloud: https://soundcloud.com/dosecanada\nInstagram: https
 ://www.instagram.com/dose.productions/\nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/@
 Dose.Productions\n\nProfile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/dose
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:80b1bc78-8497-4da5-a726-e9e7c98f78cd@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260620T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260620T130000
SUMMARY:Sensual Intelligence (Maggie Blue O'Hara)
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ed10e3df-3d11-44c9-a861-5b857c8218c4@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260620T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260620T150000
SUMMARY:Breathwave Ceremony (Yasha Wecker)
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:eeb923f2-3d3f-482b-a0c5-16d5fb51ff34@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260620T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260620T213000
SUMMARY:Ciscles
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:ciscles is a producer\, DJ\, and multi-instrumentalist based in
  Vancouver\, BC\, and a fixture of the West Coast’s underground bass sc
 ene for the past decade. His rich musical taste is deeply woven into his 
 eclectic and genre-defying sets\, encompassing everything from 140\, grime
 \, 2-step\, jungle\, R'n'B and beyond. His productions make nods toward d
 eep bass\, hip-hop and jazz\, while always pushing a forward-thinking\, p
 sychedelic tinged sound. With a slew of releases and collaborations on dec
 k\, those that know ciscles know to expect refined selections\, quality s
 onics\, and unmatched energy.\n\nSoundCloud: https://soundcloud.com/ciscle
 s\nInstagram: http://www.instagram.com/ciscles_music/\n\nProfile: https://
 thenectarfestival.com/products/ciscles
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:88986b9a-0163-472b-9ffb-6aee6958c0dc@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260620T213000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260620T230000
SUMMARY:N1ghtwork
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Night Work is an East Van DJ/producer crafting wavey UK-inspire
 d bass music rooted in beatmaking and sampling culture.\n\nDrawing on infl
 uences from R&B\, rap\, and 140-driven club sounds\, his wavey\, bass-heav
 y style\, defined by 808 weight\, chopped vocals\, and melodic fragments\,
  is built for low-lit dance floors and guaranteed to set the vibe.\n\nA lo
 ng-standing member of Chapel Sound\, involved in organizing events across 
 Vancouver. He also runs WHEEL UP\, a bass music event series centered arou
 nd grime\, dubstep\, garage\, and the local artists representing that soun
 d.\n\nSoundCloud: https://soundcloud.com/night_work\nInstagram: https://ww
 w.instagram.com/n1ght_w0rk/\nBandcamp: https://n1ghtw0rk.bandcamp.com/\n\n
 Profile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/night-work
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:1d681b4f-c178-49ca-94a8-921ba6fcaeea@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260620T230000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T003000
SUMMARY:Destrata
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Vancouver based DJ and producer Destrata is never one to be lim
 ited by a genre or style. Having released a string of EPs on notable under
 ground labels such as Scuffed Recordings\, !K7\, Spe:C\, and Of Paradise h
 e garnered the attention of Mixmag and was listed in their “25 Artists t
 o Watch in 2024” feature.\n\nPulling influence from percussive techno\, 
 uk bass\, 2-step and other forms of forward thinking modern electronic mus
 ic\, Destrata is capturing the attention of global audiences with his outp
 ut of left of center\, category defying club music.\n\nSpotify: https://op
 en.spotify.com/artist/76OnM8y64osFXktcM9g1m1?si=rWlY1mspRq64ed8JhrMr6g\nIn
 stagram: https://www.instagram.com/destrata.dj\n\nProfile: https://thenect
 arfestival.com/products/destrata
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:0b95e23e-cd08-41cf-b3ac-9b24a60a51a7@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T003000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T020000
SUMMARY:Pigeon Hole
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Veteran Vancouver Island\, BC based producer Pigeon Hole pushes
  the boundaries of their sound and sound systems alike. Known for their lo
 ngstanding catalogue of Bass music and Dubstep they experiment with evolvi
 ng song structures and heavyweight sound design resulting in a high energy
  sound and live show.\n\nSpotify: https://open.spotify.com/artist/50gZGkC4
 xYd5vJUBEnXwXP?si=tARgqZwOQ8K_QFiw_tUH7w\nInstagram: https://www.instagram
 .com/pigeon_hole\nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/pigeonholessu\n\nProfil
 e: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/pigeon-hole
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:e0115d96-965f-4250-93a2-92b81422aef4@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T020000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T033000
SUMMARY:Daega Sound
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Daega Sound is a Canadian electronic music and DJ duo formed by
  brothers Ben and Josh Searles. Since emerging from the West Coast in 2008
 \, they’ve carved out an international reputation for their deep\, heavy
 \, and meticulously crafted dubstep — a sound rooted in low-end pressure
  and sonic integrity.\n\nKnown for their forward-thinking approach\, Daega
  Sound has released music on some of dubstep’s most respected labels\, i
 ncluding Black Box\, Hatched Music\, Deep Heads\, and LoDubs\, which featu
 red a standout remix of their track “Second Strike” by UK dubstep pion
 eer Kromestar. Their own imprint\, Fathom Recordings\, debuted with the im
 mersive EP Zero\, setting the tone for a series of boundary-pushing releas
 es to come.\n\nWith support from influential tastemakers like Mary Anne Ho
 bbs\, Youngsta\, and Pinch\, Daega Sound’s music has received airplay on
  BBC Radio 1\, Rinse FM\, SubFM\, and Kiss FM\, and has echoed through sou
 nd systems at clubs and festivals across the globe.\n\nTheir live performa
 nces have evolved through various formats—from turntables and laptops to
  MIDI gear and iPads—but their current setup of four decks and two mixer
 s allows for an expressive\, high-energy\, and deeply layered experience. 
 This technical versatility is a hallmark of their live sets\, which have t
 aken them across Canada\, the UK\, and the US\, with appearances at major 
 festivals like Shambhala\, Wicked Woods\, MUTEK\, and Bass Coast.\n\nAs lo
 ng-standing members of Vancouver’s Lighta! Sound collective\, Daega Soun
 d remains a vital force in the West Coast bass music scene\, constantly ev
 olving while staying true to the roots of sound system culture.\n\n“With
 in this formative time period of the first wave of Dubstep those to the no
 rth of LoDubs land were also involved in spreading the sound\, with one of
  the key bright lights being Daega Sound of Vancouver BC... known far and 
 wide for their live PAs and blistering exclusives...”\n\n— Jon A.D.\, 
 LoDubs\n\nInstagram:\n\nFacebook:\n\nSoundCloud:\n\nInstagram: https://www
 .instagram.com/daegasound/\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/daegasound/
 \nSoundCloud: https://soundcloud.com/Daegasound\n\nProfile: https://thenec
 tarfestival.com/products/daega-sound
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:56ebad88-c8cd-4d06-8ff5-479c90055561@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T033000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T050000
SUMMARY:Living~Stone
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Host of the Sub.fm show YESYES Radio\n\nLiving~Stone\, an elect
 ronic music project spanning two decades. Born out of a love of abstract d
 eep bass\, glitchy experimental percussion and dub sounds Living~Stone has
  performed in five countries spanning three continents. Located in Canada\
 , Geoffrey Livingston also known as Living~Stone has performed with some o
 f dubstep\, drum and bass & bass music's most iconic acts.\n\nLiving~Stone
  demands your dance moves and will not rest until all are united under the
  flag of great revelry and joy. As an alchemist of frequencies\, Living~St
 one blends elements of many electronic styles always striving for the perf
 ect blend\, drop and low end rumble and is not doing his job unless the da
 nce floor is a soupy mess of high energy dance\, merriment and general ent
 husiasm.\n\nSpotify: https://open.spotify.com/artist/0oBUvZQhwO78Z66L6ZCgN
 0\nApple Music: https://music.apple.com/ng/artist/living-stone/440424104\n
 \nProfile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/living-stone
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:1c952796-bed4-48ea-bace-edba0d0e3e3d@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T131100
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T143000
SUMMARY:Solstice Ritual Theatre & Ceremony
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:138b1d90-edf1-4c81-a5d6-e74195fdda3a@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T160000
SUMMARY:Dubconscious
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Raised on amens\, Reese basslines and ragga chat in Toronto's v
 ibrant jungle scene\, Dubconscious now calls Nelson his home where he cont
 inues to weave cohesive sound tapestries coloured by his unique influences
  and handpicked sounds & styles - generally rooted in reggae / dub / sound
 system culture. You may have caught a Dubconscious set at Shambhala (eithe
 r on the Living Room Stage\, in the Grove or at The Village)\, Bass Coast\
 , Wicked Woods\, Victoria Ska & Reggae Festival\, WEMF (Ontario)\, Dragon 
 Festival (Spain) or at any one of a number of prestigious nightclubs/venue
 s across western Canada.\n\nSoundCloud: https://soundcloud.com/dubconsciou
 s\nInstagram: https://instagram.com/dubconscious\nFacebook: https://facebo
 ok.com/djdubconscious\n\nProfile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/d
 ubconscious
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:90904f0f-478a-4dac-aa1b-ce2597851c9f@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T173000
SUMMARY:Hostilis
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Coming to us from Victoria with his \, Hostilis brings a deep 
 passion for authentic soundsystem culture and the music crafted specifical
 ly for these powerful rigs. His sets traverse the rich territories of dubs
 tep\, dub\, and dub techno\, all deeply rooted in the traditions of reggae
  and soundsystem heritage. Prepare for an immersive sonic journey that hon
 ors these influences while delivering a contemporary edge to the night's s
 oundtrack.\n\nInstagram:\n\nFacebook:\n\nSoundCloud:\n\nInstagram: https:/
 /www.instagram.com/sacredrootssoundsystem/\nInstagram: https://www.instagr
 am.com/hostilis.140/\nSoundCloud: https://soundcloud.com/wennightlood\n\nP
 rofile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/hostilis
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:48304451-65eb-4211-93f0-14f02e2c78b1@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T190000
SUMMARY:Van Andreas
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Van Andreas is the moniker of Teo Van Raalte.  Lover of all th
 ings music and audio\, Teo has been DJing and making music in many forms f
 or well over a decade.  This passion has brought him all over the world\,
  and inspired him to dive deeper into the world of sound\, exploring many 
 mediums including Sound Design\, Sound for Film\, Live Sound\, Location So
 und Recording and Music Production.  This desire for variety and interest
  in blending different sound elements feeds into his Music Creation and Li
 ve Performance greatly.  Whether in his own tracks\, or in his DJ/Live se
 ts\, he strives to present a mix of genres\, that encompasses many differe
 nt feelings and emotions and pulls them all together into one cohesive jou
 rney of sound.\n\nWebsite: http://vanandreas.com\nInstagram: https://www.i
 nstagram.com/vanandreas\n\nProfile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products
 /van-andreas
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:a4428452-5fef-4bd4-a6ea-97c31846e2d3@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T203000
SUMMARY:Lady K
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:LadyK is a veritable musical force in the Comox Valley\, Vancou
 ver Island. She has been DJ'ing regularly for 15 years\, producing for 7 y
 ears and producing the Sexy Lady Show for 3 years. Her musical vibe includ
 es Afro and bass house\, Amapiano\, hip hop\, r&b and more. During her own
  shows she DJ's throughout while also performing solos and doubles on the 
 pole\, as well as group finales. She competed nationally in the Canadian P
 ole and Aerial Championship in 2024\, placing 3rd in her division. All of 
 her performing dancers have also graced the national stage.\n\nLadyK and e
 m.ash released an EP in 2023 on RF Records titled "Umusa\," featuring remi
 xes by Aspen King and Rennie Foster. She also has previous releases on Uni
 on Records as well as ISAVIS Records\, both Italian labels. They are curre
 ntly working on another EP featuring risque spoken-word poetry\; the first
  track is entitled "My Sex is Electric."\n\nLadyK has been unabashedly exp
 ressing her own fierce sensuality in an effort to inspire others to do the
  same. She embodies divine feminine empowerment in her unique artistic exp
 ression as a DJ\, pole dancer and producer.\n\nInstagram: http://www.insta
 gram.com/ladyk108\nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/@ladyk108\n\nProfile: 
 https://thenectarfestival.com/products/ladyk
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:05475d40-7dbd-4a11-854d-cee73ae4a4c1@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T220000
SUMMARY:Inphini
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Charting the unseen geometry of the sonic leading edge.\n\nReso
 nance of a mind folding into the infinite ❉ liquid transition between th
 e terrestrial and the void.\n\nA slow-blooming frequency\, vibrating throu
 gh the silence of a cosmic forest where light becomes sound.\n\nTapping in
 to the sap of existence. Deep-frequency love. A relentless\, shimmering dr
 ift toward the center of everything.\n\nJust the nectar of isness\, flowin
 g toward the light.\n\nSoundCloud: http://soundcloud.com/space_dad\nInstag
 ram: http://instagram.com/_inphini_\nInstagram: http://instagram.com/space
 phather\n\nProfile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/inphini
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:83427890-adb3-46c8-afb0-82e39b76a773@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T220000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T233000
SUMMARY:Matsya
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:For nearly two decades\, Manuel Rochette aka Matsya has been in
 volved from the ground up with festivals and events. Polymath in nature Ma
 tsya brings timely selections playing across all tempos and a wild varianc
 e in styles. Matsya’s sets are unique and tastefully unpredictable. From
  current dance beats to atmospheric ambience and sound design\, Matsya’s
  malleability and refined palette does not go unnoticed. He is also a mult
 i media event curator on Salt Spring Island and continuously helps push fr
 esh music as well as container setting to the forefront.\n\nSoundCloud: ht
 tps://soundcloud.com/matsya\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/manumats
 ya/\n\nProfile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/matsya
END:VEVENT
